      "kind": "NoOpNlpEngine",
      "modelName": "none",
      "nerAvailable": false,
      "reason": "Presidio ships NoOpNlpEngine for configurations whose recognizers are all self-contained. It loads no external model, so this trial downloads and loads no NLP weights. The cost is explicit: 2.2.364 has no PERSON recognizer outside the NLP-engine recognizers, so no person name is detectable here at all."
    },
    "contextEnhancer": "explicit no-op (LemmaContextAwareEnhancer cannot use text context with NoOpNlpEngine)",
